---
const { active = false } = Astro.props;
const HeadingTag = active ? 'h1' : 'p';
---
<section class:list={["feature-workflow-panel","production-files-page"].concat(active ? ['is-active'] : [])} data-feature-panel="ProduceFiles" hidden={!active}>
<section class="production-hero">
    <div class="production-hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="production-hero-copy">
      <HeadingTag data-feature-heading class="feature-kicker">Production-ready artwork files, generated after approval</HeadingTag>
      <h2>Approval becomes a <strong>confident handoff.</strong></h2>
      <p class="feature-lede">After customer approval, PromoPlus automatically generates production-ready PDF files with the approved artwork and placement details.</p>
      <div class="feature-actions">
        
        <a class="feature-primary-action" href="/features/customer-approval-portal">Start with approval <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="production-hero-image">
      <img src="/assets/features/production-files/production-hero.png" alt="Production lead reviewing a garment proof beside a cobalt sweatshirt">
      <figcaption><span>Approved artwork</span><b>Ready for production</b><i>PDF</i></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

    <section class="production-proof feature-shell" id="production-file">
    <header class="production-proof-copy">
      <p class="feature-kicker">The original production file</p>
      <h2>Approved product proof and artwork inspection, together.</h2>
      <p>PromoPlus keeps both original pages intact so production receives the complete approved record without cropped details.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="production-proof-pages">
      <figure class="production-proof-page production-proof-page-wide">
        <div class="production-proof-frame"><img src="/assets/promoplus/production-proof-mockup.png" alt="Product proof page with Demo Organization branding"></div>
        <figcaption><span>Page 01</span><strong>Product proof</strong></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="production-proof-page production-proof-page-artwork">
        <div class="production-proof-frame"><img src="/assets/promoplus/production-proof-artwork.png" alt="Production artwork inspection page"></div>
        <figcaption><span>Page 02</span><strong>Artwork inspection</strong></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="production-handoff">
    <figure>
      <img src="/assets/features/production-files/production-handoff.png" alt="Production handoff dashboard preview">
    </figure>
    <div>
      <p class="feature-kicker">From approval to output</p>
      <h2>A clean package for the people who make it real.</h2>
      <p>The final proof keeps the approved artwork, product sides, placement guidance, and decision record together.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><span>01</span> Approved artwork only</li>
        <li><span>02</span> Placement details included</li>
        <li><span>03</span> Ready for decorators and production teams</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="production-sequence feature-shell">
    <p class="feature-kicker">How the handoff works</p>
    <div class="production-sequence-grid">
      <article><span>Approve</span><h3>The client locks the final version.</h3><i>01</i></article>
      <article><span>Generate</span><h3>PromoPlus assembles the production PDF.</h3><i>02</i></article>
      <article><span>Produce</span><h3>Your team sends one trusted file forward.</h3><i>03</i></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-related feature-shell">
    <div class="feature-section-heading"><div><p class="feature-kicker">Connected workflow</p><h2>Start before the handoff.</h2></div><p>Production-ready files are stronger when every decision leading to them is already clear.</p></div>
    <div class="feature-related-grid">
      <a class="production-related-link" href="/features/customer-approval-portal"><small>Previous feature</small><h3>Customer Approval Portal</h3><p>Collect and record the decision that creates the final file.</p><span>Explore feature ↗</span></a>
      <a class="production-related-link" href="/features/artwork-version-control"><small>Connected feature</small><h3>Artwork Version Control</h3><p>Know exactly which version belongs in production.</p><span>Explore feature ↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-cta production-cta" id="production-cta">
    <div class="pp-cta-copy"><p class="feature-kicker">Ready to produce?</p><h2>Send one approved file forward with confidence.</h2></div>
    <div class="feature-actions"><a class="feature-primary-action" href="/contact">Talk to Sales <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="feature-secondary-action" href="/#pp-hero">View the workflow <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
  </section>
</section>
